WEBVTT

00:12:58.320 --> 00:13:00.179
and as it pulled away,

00:13:00.203 --> 00:13:03.213
you saw that it was a miniature
sitting in the palm

00:13:03.237 --> 00:13:05.116
of the girl's hands.

00:13:05.140 --> 00:13:06.944
And so I could play with the medium,

00:13:06.968 --> 00:13:09.896
and why I move from one medium to another

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:11.379
is to be able to do this.

00:13:11.403 --> 00:13:13.810
Now I'm going to take you to "Spider-Man."

00:13:13.834 --> 00:13:17.670
(Music)